OL,3,GNEWSAHalloween 'bigger than Christmas',
OL,4,Asay operators
OL,5,
OL,6,FHalloween has become so popular that
OL,7,Fsome attractions now make more money
OL,8,Ffrom the spooky season than Christmas,
OL,9,Foperators say.
OL,11,FFrom pumpkin festivals and haunted
OL,12,Fmazes to zombie experiences, businesses
OL,13,Facross the West say demand for
OL,14,FHalloween events has soared as the
OL,15,Fcelebration grows from a single night
OL,16,Finto a month-long attraction.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
