OL,3,GNEWSAHalloween 'bigger than Christmas',
OL,4,Asay operators
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt Avon Valley Adventure Park near
OL,7,FBath, Halloween activities now generate
OL,8,Faround a third of the site's annual
OL,9,Fincome. Founder Doug Douglas said:
OL,10,F"Halloween is really important for us,
OL,11,Fit has surpassed Christmas."
OL,13,F"We make half of our turnover in
OL,14,FOctober, and one third comes from the
OL,15,Fweek of Halloween alone," said David
OL,16,FGaze, owner at Chaplins fancy dress
OL,17,Fshop in Bristol.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
